      "side": 1,
      "message": "It looks like the maximum value this could be as an integer is roughly ~25 days. If this config value would ever be higher then it would need to be a long. Since there is no Android resource type for Long (weirdly enough), we\u0027d have to store this as a string in XML which gets parsed into a Long. Not sure if there\u0027s a usecase for a longer lock timeout, but something to consider.",
