      "writtenOn": "2024-11-27T17:37:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Perhaps I misunderstand, since the code in this method returns a Long (to handle the DevicePolicyManager API setting) there needs to be a conversion somewhere, either here or in Math.min where you need to send in two types that are the same?\n\nOr do you prefer to have the config as a String that is parsed as a Long?",
